  "scope": "C/Rust paired q35 KVM SMP2: 21 combined cases (12 core + 9 BRD), then 12 isolated core cases; zero skips. Queued current-CPU wake and broadcast cases require total elapsed under five seconds, before ten-second worker deadlines.",
  "selection": "Exactly one global definition of complete, complete_all and complete_on_current_cpu in selected defining object and vmlinux. Private immutable C data supplies the scheduler flag.",
