  "limitations": "Default-off partial core migration. No guarantee of CPU placement; scheduler preference is retained. Blocking waits, raw locks, swait, scheduler, initialization and status/try-wait remain C. IRQ/debug/arm64 and selected-core ext4 integration remain unverified.",
